    "name": "Algor PEW PEW",
    "steam_appid": 2599700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Algor PEW PEW is the first game from Algorhythm Project which will bring you a new experience in rogue-lite bullet-hell survival genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599700/extras/1c3ef6ba1c322102178e6c2bd3300aa4.avif?t=1727616658\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Music X Survival</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your favourite songs from Algorhythm Project in 8-bit version and survive until the last song however, the more intense the song is, the stronger enemies are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Medley mode</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the songs, Create a playlist and dive to the stage with your songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own stage and beat your own challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Party member</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you rescue an ARP, he/she will grant you his/her power and fight along side you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599700/extras/37c0ecc8694dbf613f0c1f0a86f51ddd.avif?t=1727616658\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Algor PEW PEW is the first game from Algorhythm Project which will bring you a new experience in rogue-lite bullet-hell survival genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599700/extras/1c3ef6ba1c322102178e6c2bd3300aa4.avif?t=1727616658\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Music X Survival</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your favourite songs from Algorhythm Project in 8-bit version and survive until the last song however, the more intense the song is, the stronger enemies are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Medley mode</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the songs, Create a playlist and dive to the stage with your songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own stage and beat your own challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Party member</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you rescue an ARP, he/she will grant you his/her power and fight along side you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599700/extras/37c0ecc8694dbf613f0c1f0a86f51ddd.avif?t=1727616658\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "One day, invaders from the other world attacked and kidnapped all ARPs. Your mission is to travel through parallel worlds, enjoy the rhythms, rescue the ARPs and survive until end. Let us dive you into the first rogue-lite survival game from Algorhythm Project.",
